{'symbol': 'BAC', 'date': '2022-04-12 07:00:00', 'title': 'BANK OF AMERICA ANNOUNCES REDEMPTION OF €1.5 BILLION OF FLOATING RATE SENIOR NOTES, DUE MAY 4, 2023', 'text': 'CHARLOTTE, N.C. , APRIL 12, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- BANK OF AMERICA CORPORATION ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT WILL REDEEM ON MAY 4, 2022 ALL €1,500,000,000 PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OUTSTANDING OF ITS FLOATING RATE SENIOR NOTES, DUE MAY 4, 2023 (ISIN: XS1602557495; COMMON CODE: 160255749) (THE "NOTES").'}